    "text": "For dark fringe, <br/><br/> <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image1-c41008df-196e-4ff0-bbab-90a4ecf84fbf.png\" /> <br/><br/>Here,  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>Or  <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
